sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Cluster Admin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Reconciler as MCPLifecycleOperator<br/>Reconciler
    participant PlatformCM as Platform ConfigMap
    participant APIServer as OpenShift APIServer
    participant Kustomize as Kustomize Renderer
    participant SSA as Server-Side Apply
    participant Operand as mcp-lifecycle-operator-<br/>controller-manager
    participant MCPServer as MCPServer CR

    Note over User,MCPServer: CR Reconciliation Flow

    User->>K8sAPI: Create MCPLifecycleOperator CR<br/>(cluster-scoped singleton)
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Watch event triggers reconciliation<br/>SA token auth

    Reconciler->>PlatformCM: Read platform ConfigMap<br/>Distribution detection (RHOAI vs standalone)
    PlatformCM-->>Reconciler: Distribution name + version

    Reconciler->>APIServer: Get cluster TLS profile<br/>config.openshift.io/v1/APIServer
    APIServer-->>Reconciler: TLS cipher suites + min version<br/>(fallback: Intermediate/TLS 1.2+)

    Reconciler->>Kustomize: Render embedded manifests<br/>Params: operand image, namespace, TLS profile
    Kustomize-->>Reconciler: Rendered resource set

    Reconciler->>SSA: Apply resources via SSA<br/>Field owner: mcp-lifecycle-module-operator
    SSA-->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Deployment, RBAC,<br/>ServiceMonitor, NetworkPolicies, CRD

    Note over Reconciler,Operand: Verify Operand Readiness

    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Get operand Deployment status
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Deployment ready/not ready

    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Update CR status conditions<br/>(Ready, ProvisioningSucceeded, Degraded)

    Note over Operand,MCPServer: Operand Lifecycle Management

    Operand->>K8sAPI: Watch MCPServer CRs<br/>SA: mcp-lifecycle-operator-controller-manager
    User->>K8sAPI: Create MCPServer CR (namespaced)<br/>RBAC aggregation: admin/editor/viewer
    K8sAPI-->>Operand: MCPServer watch event
    Operand->>K8sAPI: Reconcile MCPServer resources<br/>Deployments, Services, NetworkPolicies

    Note over Reconciler,SSA: Managed Resource Drift Detection

    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Watch event on managed resource<br/>Label: platform.opendatahub.io/part-of
    Reconciler->>SSA: Re-reconcile (SSA re-apply)
